> ## Problem
> 
> Finding 5.8 from the Build Club review identifies that the document search feature returns results from **all** cases, regardless of whether the authenticated user has been granted party access to those cases. In a real deployment this would be a data privacy failure. In the demo it makes the feature feel untethered from the case model.
> 
> The root cause is that `searchDocuments()` in both the **demoland** mock and **realDeal** providers searches across all documents globally without filtering by which cases the authenticated user has access to. The search page components call `documents.searchDocuments(query, filters)` without passing any user/case context.
> 
