> 
> Add an optional `allowedCaseIds?: string[]` field to the `SearchFilters` interface so the provider layer can restrict results to only documents belonging to the user's cases.
> 
> ```typescript
> export interface SearchFilters {
>   caseId?: string;
>   allowedCaseIds?: string[];  // NEW: restrict results to these cases
>   category?: DocumentCategory;
>   originator?: string;
>   dateFrom?: string;
>   dateTo?: string;
>   protectiveOrder?: ProtectiveOrderTier;
> }
> ```
