> 
> ```typescript
> if (filters?.allowedCaseIds && !filters.allowedCaseIds.includes(d.caseId)) return false;
> ```
> 
> This line should be added early in the filter chain, before the existing `caseId` filter.
> 
> ### 3. Update `searchDocumentsLocally` in `frontend-realdeal/src/providers/realdeal/storage/adl-storage.ts`
